  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e1c90a36-9604-43ec-9731-23398c902c23"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "draws one admissible ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSceneInstance"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSceneInstance", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
